/T (Meera needs to travel from Fort Kochi to Edappally for an important appointment. She opens Kochi1 feeling hopeful that the app will make the journey simple. The navigation bar shows Planner and Book Tickets, and she feels a flicker of uncertainty about which one to start with, since Planner and Book Tickets seem to mean much the same thing. She chooses Planner, enters her start and destination, and waits for a clear plan. Instead, the results combine Water Metro, Metro and feeder bus in a cluttered layout. She feels overwhelmed as she tries to work out how the modes connect, where she needs to change, and how the route fits together. Comparing the options only makes it worse, and she feels her stress rising. With the appointment drawing closer, the stress turns into panic: what if she picks the wrong route, misses a connection or arrives late? She closes the app feeling anxious and unsure, no more confident than before she opened it.)
/E (Meera needs to travel from Fort Kochi to Edappally for an important appointment. She opens Kochi1 feeling hopeful that the app will make the journey simple. The navigation bar shows Planner and Book Tickets, and she feels a flicker of uncertainty about which one to start with, since Planner and Book Tickets seem to mean much the same thing. She chooses Planner, enters her start and destination, and waits for a clear plan. Instead, the results combine Water Metro, Metro and feeder bus in a cluttered layout. She feels overwhelmed as she tries to work out how the modes connect, where she needs to change, and how the route fits together. Comparing the options only makes it worse, and she feels her stress rising. With the appointment drawing closer, the stress turns into panic: what if she picks the wrong route, misses a connection or arrives late? She closes the app feeling anxious and unsure, no more confident than before she opened it.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [0]
>>
